<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 10/11.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 10/11.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, June 11 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   11.06.97	  10.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5376	    6.5268</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3360	    2.3216</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5490	    4.5238</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5433	    3.5587</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5143	    0.5142</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7767	    0.7722</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2920	    0.2902</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0330	    7.0132</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6941	    0.6937	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2420	    1.2395</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
